# Task images/catalog data are imported on the Pi from user ZIP files.
/configs/environments/*
!/configs/environments/README.md
**/*.mp4
**/*.mkv
**/*.h264
**/*.h265
**/*.hevc
**/*.mjpeg
**/*.npz
**/*.npy
